    {
      "building_id": "B0004",
      "risk_level": "CRITICAL",
      "message": "There is critical flooding risk for your household in 1 hour. Please evacuate immediately to Char Bandar Primary School Shelter at 1.63 km away. Roads leading there will be closed soon. Prioritize moving children, older people, pregnant women and those with disabilities first. Pack essential items such as ID cards, medicine, water, food, torches, phone chargers, and cash in a sealed plastic bag for safekeeping.",
      "source": "ollama_local",
